<title>UK: Persimmon pays 6.3 mln stg for Mightover.</title>
<headline>Persimmon pays 6.3 mln stg for Mightover.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>British building group Persimmon Plc has acquired Mightover Limited for a total of 6.3 million stg, Persimmon said on Friday.</p>
<p>Mightover subsidiary Hogg Contracts Limited, based in York, owns 23 acres of building land in and around the northern English city.</p>
<p>Mightover's owners will receive 2,204,454 Persimmon ordinary shares plus 1.1 million stg in cash.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
